    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.poster.avif?t=1730715419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.webm?t=1730715419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.mp4?t=1730715419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wave your noodle arms around to assert dominance!</strong><br><br>Experience hype-filled dueling! Shoot, block, and jump your way to victory with your shotgun-rocket-launcher-that-shoots-heat-seeking-bouncy-missiles or one of the other over 11.2 million different powerup combinations.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>65+ Unique powerups<br></li><li>70+ Maps<br></li><li>AAA Face Customizer<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer<br></li><li>Local Multiplayer<br></li><li>Twitch based matchmaking<br></li><li>100% organic Noodle Arms</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/1dba3422ab140b726df21a8e595b6f2a.avif?t=1730715419\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.poster.avif?t=1730715419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.webm?t=1730715419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/ca83a0a015551a24ab501615d6bb752c.mp4?t=1730715419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wave your noodle arms around to assert dominance!</strong><br><br>Experience hype-filled dueling! Shoot, block, and jump your way to victory with your shotgun-rocket-launcher-that-shoots-heat-seeking-bouncy-missiles or one of the other over 11.2 million different powerup combinations.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>65+ Unique powerups<br></li><li>70+ Maps<br></li><li>AAA Face Customizer<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer<br></li><li>Local Multiplayer<br></li><li>Twitch based matchmaking<br></li><li>100% organic Noodle Arms</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1557740/extras/1dba3422ab140b726df21a8e595b6f2a.avif?t=1730715419\" /></div>",
